{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41832","headline":"春晚过明氏闲居 · 李中","name":"春晚过明氏闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥寥陋巷独扃门，自乐清虚不厌贫。\n数局棊中消永日，一罇酒里送残春。\n雨催绿藓铺三径，风送飞花入四邻。\n羡尔朗吟无外事，沧洲何必去垂纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}